			<div class="content" id="post-content-2837226">
									

<p>Second ever mainlist, first fifthist skip, hope i did them justice</p>
<p>I wanted to make this one similar but different to Star Signals.</p>
<p>Artist was not popular enough to cause a wide scale breach, but if they were, you'd have a 1425-level fuckup.</p>
<p>I also wanted to really expand the scope of the Fifthist universe, while still only implying whatever it is Fifthists worship. Basically pure chaotic destruction by a number of different skips</p>
<p>It's not as horrid as your typical fifth skip, but it still has their self keeping secrets and an implication of horror that extends beyond the scope of the writing.</p>
<p>Or at least, that's what I'm going for.</p>
<p>thanks yall!</p>

