<p>Involve the progression of the pieces to use the third album, <em>Freeman</em>, as the focal point. Free man? That was the performance that would bring -1 right here, full form. It's a 3 hour performance.</p>
<p><em>Borealis</em> would then be Cage's attempt to undo his mistakes, a performance that contained him and allowed him to live his normal life til his weird ass died four years later.</p>
